  "beschreibung": "获取全套TED资料（音频、视频、英中双语对照文本），请关注公众号【悦读烩】\n\nAs chief content officer of Forbes, Randall Lane oversees the magazine's signature list of billionaires, tracking the richest people on Earth. But he has noticed that this prompts the ultra-wealthy to stockpile their money instead of spending it on the public good. He debuts a new ranking -- True Net Worth -- that applauds billionaires for their philanthropy and rewards generosity. Guess who's in the top five?\n作为《福布斯》首席内容官，兰德尔·莱恩（Randall Lane）负责该杂志标志性的亿万富翁榜单，追踪全球最富有的人群。但他注意到，这反而促使超级富豪们囤积财富，而非将其用于公共福祉。因此，他推出了一项全新排名——“真实净资产”，旨在表彰亿万富翁的慈善行为，并奖励慷慨捐赠。猜猜前五名都有谁？",
  "beschreibung_html": "<p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\">获取全套TED资料（音频、视频、英中双语对照文本），请关注公众号【悦读烩】</p><hr style=\"border:0px;margin:20px 0px;background:#ddd;display:inline-block;width:100%;border-style:solid;height:1px;\"><br><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\">As chief content officer of Forbes, Randall Lane oversees the magazine's signature list of billionaires, tracking the richest people on Earth. But he has noticed that this prompts the ultra-wealthy to stockpile their money instead of spending it on the public good. He debuts a new ranking -- True Net Worth -- that applauds billionaires for their philanthropy and rewards generosity. Guess who's in the top five?</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\">作为《福布斯》首席内容官，兰德尔·莱恩（Randall Lane）负责该杂志标志性的亿万富翁榜单，追踪全球最富有的人群。但他注意到，这反而促使超级富豪们囤积财富，而非将其用于公共福祉。因此，他推出了一项全新排名——“真实净资产”，旨在表彰亿万富翁的慈善行为，并奖励慷慨捐赠。猜猜前五名都有谁？</p>",
